        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the must-play quiz for every pinball fan! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unexpected stories, iconic machines, legendary manufacturers… and a few tricky surprises along the way. Dive into the world of pinball and find out if your knowledge matches your reflexes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882910/extras/61e440e583bbf72c04c107452ed41890.poster.avif?t=1760540789\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882910/extras/61e440e583bbf72c04c107452ed41890.webm?t=1760540789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882910/extras/61e440e583bbf72c04c107452ed41890.mp4?t=1760540789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some example questions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which pinball personality appears on the <i>Back to the Future</i> flyer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which city is considered the birthplace of pinball?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What object is above the central spinner on the Tales of the Arabian Nights pinball?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What do you call a pinball enthusiast?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more …</p>",
